{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b5551d212989ecc8","name":"Darth Krayt's Holocron","source":{"id":"source:reference-b5551d212989ecc8","title":"Darth Krayt's Holocron","revision":20131,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:16:27Z","sha256":"f06c818cf0ff9a13dd28ef056baec2c5c35d5ebd960e453ff999dcd4f387278a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20131","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Darth%20Krayt%27s%20Holocron&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b5551d212989ecc8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["There is a secret known only to two individuals in the galaxy that could prove to be the catalyst for great change: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"},", Emperor of the galaxy and ruler of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},", is dying. However, this is not the only secret shared by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Wyyrlok"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Wyyrlok","referenceId":"reference:835dc2fee45de568"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Since ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"}," discovered the true extent of his body's degradation, the Sith Lord has been crafting a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holocron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holocron"}," to store the sum total of his knowledge as well as his beliefs and philosophies. However, at the height of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith-Imperial War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith-Imperial_War"},", this Holocron is not yet complete. Despite this fact, the Holocron is still a repository for great knowledge, including many secrets and bits of lore known only to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"}," himself.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Were the Holocron to fall into the hands of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hidden Temple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hidden_Temple"},", it could be analyzed for signs of weakness and perhaps uncover secret plans previously unknown to the galaxy at large. If the Holocron were found by Darth Krayt's rivals within ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},", it could lead to a coup d'etat, further fragmenting the Empire and plunging the galaxy into a war of many factions.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
